                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Nephi 20:5",
        "book": "2 Nephi",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "I will send him against a hypocritical nation, and against the people of my wrath will I give him a charge to take the spoil, and to take the prey, and to tread them down like the mire of the streets.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 45,
            "text": "IE against Israel. TG Hypocrisy."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Nephi 20:6",
        "book": "2 Nephi",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Howbeit he meaneth not so, neither doth his heart think so; but in his heart it is to destroy and cut off nations not a few.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Nephi 20:7",
        "book": "2 Nephi",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "For he saith: Are not my princes altogether kings?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 32,
            "text": "2 Kgs. 18:33 (33–35); 19:10 (10–13)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Nephi 20:8",
        "book": "2 Nephi",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Is not Calno as Carchemish? Is not Hamath as Arpad? Is not Samaria as Damascus?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 7,
            "end": 12,
            "text": "Amos 6:2 (1–2)."
