      },
      {
        "text": "As my hand hath founded the kingdoms of the idols, and whose graven images did excel them of Jerusalem and of Samaria;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 3,
            "end": 10,
            "text": "IE the king of Assyria’s hand ( vv. 10–11)."
          }
